00:02:09.941 --> 00:02:10.774
(laughing)

00:02:10.774 --> 00:02:11.607
Hey!

00:02:11.607 --> 00:02:12.440
We gotta do this more often, huh?

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:13.273
Definitely.

00:02:13.273 --> 00:02:14.394
