00:02:14.394 --> 00:02:15.881
Group hug.

00:02:15.881 --> 00:02:17.255
Bring it in.
You guys are the best.

00:02:17.255 --> 00:02:19.013
Hey, sorry I was in prison.

00:02:19.013 --> 00:02:19.846
(laughing)

00:02:19.846 --> 00:02:20.679
It's not your fault.

00:02:20.679 --> 00:02:22.003
Well, it actually was my fault.

00:02:22.003 --> 00:02:22.836
